motions.motion_text:
WHEREAS; Councillor Brown tabled the Notice of Motion titled Amending the Scope of the McBean Street Resurfacing Project at the October 3 2024 ARAC meeting; and
WHEREAS the implications for Planning, Development and Building Services were not available at the time of Publication;
THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that the Departmental Implications section be amended to include the attached comment from Planning, Development and Building Services.
